# Exclude the entire web (npm) binding from the published pub.dev package.
# `@willink-labs/pulse` is generated from the same token contract as the Dart
# code in lib/, but it ships to npm, not to pub.dev — a Flutter consumer has no
# use for the CSS and would pay for it in every `pub get`. Scoping the exclude
# here (rather than a root .pubignore) keeps the root .gitignore in effect for
# build/, .dart_tool/, etc. — a root .pubignore would replace it.
#
# The reverse exclusion (keeping lib/ out of the npm tarball) is handled by the
# `files` field in web/package.json, which allowlists dist/ + README.md only.
*
